	(text "Push-button buzzer, 6 V (4 x AA), 5 V magnetic buzzer ~40 mA\nI_B = (6 - 0.75) V / 2.2 k - 0.75 V / 47 k = 2.4 mA\nI_C / hFE_min = 40 mA / 60 = 0.67 mA -> 3.5x margin, saturated\nR2 47k: base pull-down; D1: flyback clamp across BZ1"
